  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "世界經濟—核心概念與趨勢",
    "sub_ename": "WORLD ECONOMIES: CORE CONCEPTS AND TRENDS",
    "describe_ch": "沿著偉大經濟學家的思路與演變，本課程將介紹政治經濟學的基本概念，並透過小組討論、資料蒐集與專題報告等方式，與同學一同解讀當前世界經濟的金融、科技、產業與社會轉型等關鍵趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "Following the theoretical development of great economists, this course will introduce the basic concepts of Political Economics. In the process of group discussion, data collection and special report, teachers and students will discuss the key trends of the current world economy such as finance, technology, industry and society transformation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
